ontent": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "  Talking About Daily Routines"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Daily routines are things you do every day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about daily routines, you use the Present Tense and a preposition of time like <span class=\"strong\">at, until, by and from \u2026 to.</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use expressions of time like <span class=\"strong\">On Saturdays ...</span>  to say that you do things on a regular basis."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Preposition or Expression of Time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I wake up at 7:00 a.m. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"until\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a period of time leading up to a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm in class until 3:00 in the afternoon.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"by\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" at or before\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I should be home by 6:00.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"from ... to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the beginning and ending time of an activity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I have classes from 9:00 to 3:00 every day. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on (Saturdays) ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the same day of the week  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't have classes on Saturdays. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Modals Should, Could, Have to, Must"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"strong\">should</span>  and <span class=\"strong\">could</span>  to give recommendations or advice. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">could</span> and <span class=\"strong\">should</span>  to show a recommendation -- what is recommendable.<br /><br />You can use <span class=\"strong\">could</span>  to show possibility -- what is possible."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">should</span>  to show expectation -- what is expected."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modals <span class=\"strong\">must</span>  and <span class=\"strong\">have to</span>  show necessity or obligation. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recommendation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You should make lasagna tonight.   </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recommendation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I could make pasta. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recommendation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> We could go to a concert this weekend.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expectation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I should be in school by 9 every day.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Obligation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I have to wake up at 7:00 a.m. tomorrow.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Obligation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I must arrive on time tomorrow. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le04ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "unit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a series of lessons"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: So what's your first unit in school?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about a daily schedule."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "schedule"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the time you do things on a regular basis"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What's your schedule like now that you're in cooking school? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to skip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not do something you usually do  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Don't skip any classes!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to expect  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to plan on something happening"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When can I expect you home for dinner?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "attendance   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being present"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Attendance in class is mandatory."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mandatory "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes something you have to do"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is mandatory to attend every class."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be late   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to arrive after the planned time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can't be late for class."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of 5 - 8 daily routines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include something that you need to do or should do in your routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the time of the day (3:00 ...) you do each thing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain your routine to a partner. Use prepositions like <span class=\"italic\">at</span>, <span class=\"italic\">by</span>, <span class=\"italic\">until</span> and <span class=\"italic\">from ... to</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's routines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss how your routines are the same or different as you."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my daily routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things I need to do or should do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the time of day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss daily routines with my partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}